    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi></math> be the area of the region&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. Then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>21</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
