  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Plotting the diagram of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0063_25c4e1e2423c.png\" style=\"width: 265px; height: 250px;\" /></p><p>Now from above diagram required Area&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mo>=</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>21</mn></msqrt></msubsup><msqrt><mn>21</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>21</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>21</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>21</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>21</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
